      ],
      "en": "In the reign of Ahasuerus, in the beginning of his reign, they wrote an accusation against the inhabitants of Judah and Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "또 아하수에로가 즉위할 때에 저희가 글을 올려 유다와 예루살렘 거민을 고소하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b0d118cde9e303c3e051d68e78a7d83307b3801752e9096f4cf68127c75471df",
      "translation_text_hash": "e350d5ad844eae343d7d559b9654d9ce2dd804069ad0a67cdb6da7105fbaa901",
