      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZR",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "Be careful that you not be slack doing so. Why should damage grow to the hurt of the kings?",
      "ko": "너희는 삼가서 이 일에 게으르지 말라 어찌하여 화를 더하여 왕들에게 손해가 되게 하랴 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "4153e3c93bde92eb01cc96fc174556828fb8227d74bfbcc88e273b6fb80ad01b",
      "translation_text_hash": "d788024e76c16c1db1e06099f2467e6e5e89e31c5b74d58150b7dbc7d850cb1e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
